-- A field's options are named after the place they are written,
-- `Plot's tenure`. A type of that name declared as near to the field is a
-- clash, reported once, at the field, with the generated name and the other
-- declaration's location (specs/proposals/INLINE-ONE-OF-FIELD-SPEC.md §6
-- item 8).
DECLARE `Plot's tenure` IS ONE OF Freehold, Leasehold

DECLARE Plot HAS
    `the occupier` IS A STRING
    `tenure`       IS ONE OF Owner, Tenant, Lodger
